{"4633140":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"My Singing Monsters Karaoke","steam_appid":4633140,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"dlc":[4831810],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>What in the World of My Singing Monsters?!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience My Singing Monsters like never before! Your favorite Monsters are ready to perform, but keeping them on-key is not as easy as you think. Follow the notes, keep the music groovin’, and lead your favorite Monster singers through a series of wacky and wild performances!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4633140\/extras\/4388b8c4fb6ce361e7c4732658b4ec0a.poster.avif?t=1787239921\" width=550 height=308 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4633140\/extras\/4388b8c4fb6ce361e7c4732658b4ec0a.webm?t=1787239921\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4633140\/extras\/4388b8c4fb6ce361e7c4732658b4ec0a.mp4?t=1787239921\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As the music builds up, so does the chaos. Watch your Monsters react to every note with hilarious expressions, outlandish animations, and hysterical distortions! Bulging eyes, goofy smiles, and wobbly faces move to the beat as your karaoke performance reaches new highs (and lows).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4633140\/extras\/6b3dcaaad1f307c316d0f565da35b5fd.poster.avif?t=1787239921\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4633140\/extras\/6b3dcaaad1f307c316d0f565da35b5fd.webm?t=1787239921\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4633140\/extras\/6b3dcaaad1f307c316d0f565da35b5fd.mp4?t=1787239921\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every Monster brings its own Monsterful voice, personality, and style to the stage, creating a show that you could only expect from the wacky world of My Singing Monsters. From chasing the perfect score or creating a silly spectacle, every song is jam-packed with personality, humor, and charm that could only be created by your favorite Monsters.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4633140\/extras\/76ee4c405723eb8c9c35bfa05778c758.poster.avif?t=1787239921\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4633140\/extras\/76ee4c405723eb8c9c35bfa05778c758.webm?t=1787239921\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4633140\/extras\/76ee4c405723eb8c9c35bfa05778c758.mp4?t=1787239921\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Challenge your favorite classic My Singing Monsters songs, or load your own custom songs for even more fun! My Singing Monsters Karaoke is compatible with a wide variety of fan created song chart databases! For an extra challenge, try playing with a custom controller!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hop on the Karaoke stage and perform your favorite hits, one wacky Monster at a time!<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand new musical experience set in the Musical World of My Singing Monsters<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as your favorite Monsters in a way you never thought possible, with familiar voices and uniquely unforgettable performances<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the notes to keep the show on track, or go off-script for a truly memorable experience<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impress a quirky panel of Monster judges with your scoring skills, or show them just how off-key you can really be<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load in custom songs from a variety of fan created song chart databases<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>What in the World of My Singing Monsters?!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience My Singing Monsters like never before! Your favorite Monsters are ready to perform, but keeping them on-key is not as easy as you think. Follow the notes, keep the music groovin’, and lead your favorite Monster singers through a series of wacky and wild performances!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4633140\/extras\/4388b8c4fb6ce361e7c4732658b4ec0a.poster.avif?t=1787239921\" width=550 height=308 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4633140\/extras\/4388b8c4fb6ce361e7c4732658b4ec0a.webm?t=1787239921\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4633140\/extras\/4388b8c4fb6ce361e7c4732658b4ec0a.mp4?t=1787239921\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As the music builds up, so does the chaos. Watch your Monsters react to every note with hilarious expressions, outlandish animations, and hysterical distortions! Bulging eyes, goofy smiles, and wobbly faces move to the beat as your karaoke performance reaches new highs (and lows).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4633140\/extras\/6b3dcaaad1f307c316d0f565da35b5fd.poster.avif?t=1787239921\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4633140\/extras\/6b3dcaaad1f307c316d0f565da35b5fd.webm?t=1787239921\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4633140\/extras\/6b3dcaaad1f307c316d0f565da35b5fd.mp4?t=1787239921\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every Monster brings its own Monsterful voice, personality, and style to the stage, creating a show that you could only expect from the wacky world of My Singing Monsters. From chasing the perfect score or creating a silly spectacle, every song is jam-packed with personality, humor, and charm that could only be created by your favorite Monsters.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4633140\/extras\/76ee4c405723eb8c9c35bfa05778c758.poster.avif?t=1787239921\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4633140\/extras\/76ee4c405723eb8c9c35bfa05778c758.webm?t=1787239921\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4633140\/extras\/76ee4c405723eb8c9c35bfa05778c758.mp4?t=1787239921\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Challenge your favorite classic My Singing Monsters songs, or load your own custom songs for even more fun! My Singing Monsters Karaoke is compatible with a wide variety of fan created song chart databases! For an extra challenge, try playing with a custom controller!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hop on the Karaoke stage and perform your favorite hits, one wacky Monster at a time!<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand new musical experience set in the Musical World of My Singing Monsters<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as your favorite Monsters in a way you never thought possible, with familiar voices and uniquely unforgettable performances<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the notes to keep the show on track, or go off-script for a truly memorable experience<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impress a quirky panel of Monster judges with your scoring skills, or show them just how off-key you can really be<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load in custom songs from a variety of fan created song chart databases<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Choose your favorite Monster and hop on the karaoke stage for the performance of a lifetime! Hit the notes, conduct the chaos, and watch your favorite Monster performers squish, stretch, and contort through every song. Whether you’re pitch-perfect or off key, every karaoke concert will be memorable!","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4633140\/f4ee7e724a90a05608e8989d02bbfaca5dbac77d\/header.jpg?t=1787239921","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4633140\/00a76a59790eff1ca105d52254bc84126a5adf92\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787239921","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4633140\/00a76a59790eff1ca105d52254bc84126a5adf92\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787239921","website":"https:\/\/www.bigbluebubble.com\/home\/games\/my-singing-monsters-series\/my-singing-monsters-karaoke\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Pentium G3220\/AMD Athlon X4 970K<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 650\/AMD Radeon R7 350X OEM<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-4690\/AMD FX-8320<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia GeForce GT 1030\/AMD Radeon RX550<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"legal_notice":"©2026 Big Blue Bubble Inc. 